<section class="hero bento">
  <article class="hero-card bento-card span-2">
    <p class="eyebrow">Personal Blog</p>
    <h1>工程、设计和生活，都应该被好好归档。</h1>
    <p class="hero-text">这里会放电子信息工程的学习笔记、PCB 设计过程、项目复盘，也会放摄影、模型和一些日常记录。首页先保持克制，内容以后慢慢长出来。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="<%- url_for('/notes/') %>">进入笔记</a>
      <a class="button ghost" href="<%- url_for('/life/') %>">看生活</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <a class="bento-card module-large" href="<%- url_for('/pcb/') %>">
    <span class="card-index">01</span>
    <strong>PCB 设计</strong>
    <small>原理图、封装、布局布线、打样、焊接、调试和版本记录。</small>
  </a>

  <a class="bento-card module-small" href="<%- url_for('/notes/') %>">
    <span class="card-index">02</span>
    <strong>学习笔记</strong>
    <small>电路、信号、通信、嵌入式、GNSS。</small>
  </a>

  <a class="bento-card module-small" href="<%- url_for('/projects/') %>">
    <span class="card-index">03</span>
    <strong>项目作品</strong>
    <small>课程设计、硬件作品、完整复盘。</small>
  </a>

  <a class="bento-card module-wide" href="<%- url_for('/life/') %>">
    <span class="card-index">04</span>
    <strong>生活与作品</strong>
    <small>摄影、模型、旅行、随笔，还有那些不必被归进课程表里的东西。</small>
  </a>
</section>

<section class="section-grid">
  <div class="section-main">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Recent Updates</p>
      <h2>最近记录</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="post-list">
      <% site.posts.sort('date', -1).limit(6).forEach(function(post) { %>
        <article class="post-card">
          <time datetime="<%= post.date.format('YYYY-MM-DD') %>"><%= post.date.format('YYYY.MM.DD') %></time>
          <h3><a href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>"><%= post.title %></a></h3>
          <p><%= strip_html(post.excerpt || post.content).replace(/\s+/g, ' ').substring(0, 118) %></p>
        </article>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="module-rail">
    <div class="section-heading compact">
      <p class="eyebrow">Index</p>
      <h2>站点索引</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="rail-link" href="<%- url_for('/about/') %>">关于我和这个站点</a>
    <a class="rail-link" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">按时间查看全部文章</a>
    <a class="rail-link" href="<%- url_for('/links/') %>">常用链接与工具</a>
  </aside>
</section>
